{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "WRF",
    "description": "WRF regridding model — the coupler half of the wrf loader+regridding-model split (RFC pure-io-data-loaders §6/§7; bead esm-3nc.1). Exposes WRF regional weather fields (UCAR RDA d340000, WRF-Chem v3.9.1 CONUS 12 km) on the simulation's target grid for advection and chemistry coupling in EarthSciML systems.\n\nStructure (RFC pure-io-data-loaders §6):\n  1. It declares the pure-I/O loader (components/earthsci_data/wrf_loader.esm) as the subsystem `raw` via {\"ref\": \"./wrf_loader.esm\"}. Loader fields are referenced as raw.<var> (e.g. raw.U) and re-exposed as model-level observed variables (WRF.U, WRF.V, ...) to preserve the runtime MeanWind coupling contract (WRF.U/V/W → MeanWind via WRFCoupler/couple2).\n  2. Reprojection: WRF's native grid is projected (lambert_conformal), so the coordinate transform is the LCC reproject (ESD reprojection/lambert_conformal.esm, esd-47z.2) — selected by convention from the loader's grid.crs.projection = 'lambert_conformal' and parameterized by the loader's crs parameters {lat_1:30, lat_2:60, lat_0:38.999996, lon_0:-97, R:6370000}.\n  3. Regridding (per variable, RFC §5.2): the Arakawa-C-grid wind components U, V, W are edge/face-staggered → B-spline interpolation; the cell-centered scalars T, PH, PHB, P, PB, QVAPOR → conservative (area-weighted, mass-conserving) regridding. Declared in the `regrid` block.\n\nTop-level derived quantities computed on the target grid: total pressure P_total = P + PB, geopotential height z = (PH + PHB)/g, and the lat/lon coordinate metrics δxδlon and δyδlat (emitted only for lat/lon coordinate domains).\n\nMeanWind coupling (from EarthSciData.jl@830435a coupling.jl): MeanWind.v_lon ~ WRF.U, MeanWind.v_lat ~ WRF.V, MeanWind.v_lev ~ WRF.W.\n\nMigrated from EarthSciData.jl@830435a065f27e99f10bba91107ca1730322cc6b:src/wrf.jl:169 (WRF constructor, esm-4l84); split into pure loader + regridding model by esm-3nc.1.",
    "tags": [
      "earthsci_data",
      "meteorology",
      "atmospheric_dynamics",
      "regridding_model",
      "regional_climate",
      "wrf",
      "conus",
      "lambert_conformal"
    ],
    "created": "2026-06-25T00:00:00Z",
